WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:03.247
(happy calm music)

00:00:06.950 --> 00:00:08.750
- I served in the Air
Force for four years.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:09.800
Hey Mister Mitt.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.283
I've wanted my hair like this
since I was a little girl.

00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:19.164
And when I joined Military
it was just a no-go.

00:00:19.164 --> 00:00:22.331
(light hip-hop music)

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.670
- I served in the army for six years.

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:30.280
- I served in the United Sates
Air Force for four years.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.220
- I served in the Air Force for six years.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:33.590
And I could tell that the regulations

00:00:33.590 --> 00:00:35.260
weren't necessarily written by people

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.910
who had knowledge of black
hair and how it worked.

00:00:38.910 --> 00:00:41.410
- I served in the United
States Air Force for 23 years.

00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:45.092
I decided to go natural
by locking my hair.

00:00:45.092 --> 00:00:48.042
Davette is awesome and she was
a godsend when I found her.

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:51.290
- The military has requirements

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:52.903
on how they can wear their hair.

00:00:53.830 --> 00:00:55.107
It used to be that women could not

00:00:55.107 --> 00:00:57.230
wear locs in the military.

00:00:57.230 --> 00:00:59.183
Now they are in regulation.

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:04.164
It's such a freedom; it's freedom.

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:07.331
(light hip-hop music)

00:01:14.661 --> 00:01:17.161
(piano music)

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:21.210
I've been working with
women in the military

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:23.180
for nearly 30 years.

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:26.470
About 95% of my clientele is active duty

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:27.973
or retired military.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:32.980
You have a lot of strong
women in the military;

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.910
they want to concentrate on
protecting the United Sates,

00:01:35.910 --> 00:01:38.356
and not be concentrating on whether or not

00:01:38.356 --> 00:01:41.330
their hair is in regulation.

00:01:41.330 --> 00:01:45.300
The Coast Guard changed the
regulations about four year ago.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.390
The Army followed like a year ago,

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.870
and the Air Force about six months ago.

00:01:49.870 --> 00:01:53.330
With this new changed now
African-American women

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:56.913
can feel good and also look
correct in their uniforms.

00:01:58.594 --> 00:02:00.780
(piano music)

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:02.580
- I've bee in the Air Force for two years.

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:06.990
I was so excited about the
change that I felt like locs

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:10.550
were how I was going to
be able to express myself,

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.283
and show people who I am.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.860
- How you doing today?
- I'm doing well,

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:17.790
how are you?
- You ready for me?

00:02:17.790 --> 00:02:19.480
- I'm ready.
- Hey.

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:21.670
When the young recruits come in

00:02:21.670 --> 00:02:23.580
it's very important to me,

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:26.144
that they feel safe and comfortable.

00:02:26.144 --> 00:02:27.850
(laughing)

00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:30.130
And I had to really learn what was allowed

00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:31.770
and what wasn't allowed.

00:02:31.770 --> 00:02:33.920
When people are not in regulations

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:35.640
they get in really big trouble

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.380
with their Commanding Officers.

00:02:37.380 --> 00:02:40.163
So we had to make sure that
they stay in regulation.

00:02:41.100 --> 00:02:43.570
After I finished Emoni’s hair, she turned around

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:46.410
and looked in the mirror; I
could just see in her eyes

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:47.653
she was so happy.

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:51.430
- My hair really doesn't
define how well I can perform

00:02:51.430 --> 00:02:54.830
my job but in a lot of ways
it enhances my personality,

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:57.550
because it is allowing me to be myself.

00:02:57.550 --> 00:03:00.820
You can't serve if you're
not able to be yourself.

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.850
I love putting on my uniform everyday.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.070
I have Covington and the
United States Air Force

00:03:05.070 --> 00:03:05.903
on my heart.

00:03:05.903 --> 00:03:08.610
With my locs now, I feel
complete in my uniform.

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:11.690
But I carry the new regulations in my wallet

00:03:11.690 --> 00:03:14.650
just in case anyone
approaches me about my hair.

00:03:14.650 --> 00:03:16.943
No one has because Davette keeps me good.

